One revolution at 8 mm/s: 49 s. N=3 revolutions: 146 s.
K=8 touches: table moves 45 deg (about 6 s at 7.4 deg/s), wall touch about 10 s (fast then slow), so about 128 s. Not faster; different (no judge bias).
